WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.848
COLLECT. Show a leaf, goat, stone, plastic cup and growing grass.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.367
SORT. Place goat and grass in the living column.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.879
SORT. Place stone and plastic cup in the non-living column.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.007
EXPLAIN. Movement alone does not prove that something is living.
